The three FP8 dispatches are pinned rather than rewritten. Each selected a
CUTLASS configuration by M, and the configurations disagree in their last bits,
so the native result moved with the shape and could not serve as a baseline for
an accumulation. The unselected configurations are left in place: this is a
change of policy, not a deletion.

